out.vPosFromLight_1 = shadowInfo_1.lightMatrix * worldPos4;
out.vDepthMetric_1 = (out.vPosFromLight_1.z + shadowInfo_1.depthValues.x) / shadowInfo_1.depthValues.y;",
  },
}
`;

